WEBVTT

00:00:00.569 --> 00:00:02.475
Narrator: Meet your radio.

00:00:02.666 --> 00:00:04.573
Narrator: On, off and volume.

00:00:04.763 --> 00:00:06.670
Narrator: The channel selector.

00:00:11.077 --> 00:00:13.071
Narrator: The push-to-talk button.

00:00:13.270 --> 00:00:15.762
Narrator: The antenna, the screen, and your earpiece.

00:00:21.644 --> 00:00:27.380
Narrator: Earpieces matter - stadiums are loud, and fans should not hear every message.
